			"cells": [
				{
					"cell_id": 6177010362182707972,
					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "The Christoffel terms have cancelled, as they should: the variation of $\\mathcal{L}^{(3/2)}$\nhas to be covariant. Adding the variation of the explicit vielbeine, everything left is\nof the form $\\bar\\epsilon\\psi\\,\\bar\\psi D\\psi$ or $\\bar\\psi\\psi\\,\\bar\\epsilon D\\psi$.\nTo compare these we first move the bilinears containing $\\bar\\epsilon$ to the front."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
			"source": "The Christoffel terms have cancelled, as they should: the variation of $\\mathcal{L}^{(3/2)}$\nhas to be covariant. Adding the variation of the explicit vielbeine, everything left is\nof the form $\\bar\\epsilon\\psi\\,\\bar\\psi D\\psi$ or $\\bar\\psi\\psi\\,\\bar\\epsilon D\\psi$.\nTo compare these we first move the bilinears containing $\\bar\\epsilon$ to the front."
		},
