					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "\\subsection*{Fierz rearrangement}\n\nNext we Fierz all terms so that $\\bar\\epsilon$ and $D\\psi$ sit in the same bilinear\n(vN~1.7 eq.~(12)). For this, \\verb|fierz| needs to know that the covariant derivative of the\ngravitino is a spinor."
				}
			],
			"hidden": true,
