					"cell_origin": "client",
					"cell_type": "latex_view",
					"source": "This completes the proof that the action $\\mathcal{L}^{(2)} + \\mathcal{L}^{(3/2)}$ is invariant\nunder the local supersymmetry transformations\n$\\delta e^m{}_\\mu = \\tfrac12\\bar\\epsilon\\Gamma^m\\psi_\\mu$, $\\delta\\psi_\\mu = D_\\mu\\epsilon$."
				}
			],
